Package: miadi-music-measure
Version: 0.1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: The Python that measures music on a Miadi host, in its own venv
 NumPy, SciPy and Pillow, pinned, in /usr/lib/miadi-music/venv. The venv is
 built at install from the wheels in this package, never from PyPI, so a
 NumPy in /usr/local, a conda install or a distribution SciPy cannot pair
 with it wrongly. Pitch tracking, spectral share, onset detection and score
 images run under /usr/lib/miadi-music/venv/bin/python3, or
 `miadi-music python` (package miadi-music).
